            "line": 434,
            "text": "theorem extension_eq_series (z : ℝ × X) :\n    extension a ha z = ∑' j : ℕ,\n      (SmoothCutoffs.cutoff ((scale a ha j : ℝ) * z.1) *\n        (z.1 ^ j / (j.factorial : ℝ))) • a j z.2"
